<title>UK: Prudential says '96 single sales up 69 pct.</title>
<headline>Prudential says '96 single sales up 69 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British insurance group Prudential Plc said on Monday global single contribution sales rose by 69 percent to 6,662 million pounds in 1996 and regular contribution sales rose 13 percent to 516 million.</p>
<p>Prudential said in a statement that single contribution sales in Britain rose 71 percent to 3,569 million pounds and regular contribution sales were up eight percent.</p>
</text>
